{"4884050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nothing to See Here", "steam_appid": 4884050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and paint your own 3D objects as camouflage to hide in plain sight. Shape almost anything, blend in anywhere, and outsmart seekers across more than a dozen maps.<br><br>Use intuitive 3D modeling and painting tools to recreate the world around you, build convincing camouflage, and challenge your friends in a unique multiplayer hide-and-seek experience where creativity is your greatest advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape, Paint &amp; Hide as Almost Anything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/8cd0b285c668d984aab3ec5d365e8364.poster.avif?t=1786710545\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/8cd0b285c668d984aab3ec5d365e8364.webm?t=1786710545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/8cd0b285c668d984aab3ec5d365e8364.mp4?t=1786710545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom 3D objects using intuitive modeling tools, then paint them to perfectly match the environment. Powerful yet easy-to-use tools let you quickly create almost anything and seamlessly blend it into the environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outsmart the Seekers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/2a1cd2950dd0d08c6bdebe866a7b5e39.poster.avif?t=1786710545\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/2a1cd2950dd0d08c6bdebe866a7b5e39.webm?t=1786710545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/2a1cd2950dd0d08c6bdebe866a7b5e39.mp4?t=1786710545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detail matters. Blend into the environment as accurately as possible, because even the smallest mistake can give you away. Seekers will inspect every object with suspicion, knowing that any one of them could be another player hiding in plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, rewarding to master. As your skills improve, your camouflage becomes increasingly convincing. With practice, you'll recreate increasingly detailed and realistic objects that are almost impossible to spot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Than a Dozen Unique Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/255ab953a9b71fe4546e5630238f2c9e.poster.avif?t=1786710545\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/255ab953a9b71fe4546e5630238f2c9e.webm?t=1786710545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/255ab953a9b71fe4546e5630238f2c9e.mp4?t=1786710545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore more than a dozen unique maps, each filled with its own architecture, props, and visual style. Every environment offers new camouflage possibilities, whether you're recreating existing objects or inventing ones that naturally belong there.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Best Creations Don't Disappear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/eac2e603e8483a70b0e10bc5ea8aab42.poster.avif?t=1786710545\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/eac2e603e8483a70b0e10bc5ea8aab42.webm?t=1786710545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/eac2e603e8483a70b0e10bc5ea8aab42.mp4?t=1786710545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great camouflage deserves more than a few seconds of attention. At the end of each round, save your favorite creation as a screenshot, admire everyone's best creations together in the lobby, and showcase the best creations as paintings throughout the lobby.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and paint your own 3D objects as camouflage to hide in plain sight. Shape almost anything, blend in anywhere, and outsmart seekers across more than a dozen maps.<br><br>Use intuitive 3D modeling and painting tools to recreate the world around you, build convincing camouflage, and challenge your friends in a unique multiplayer hide-and-seek experience where creativity is your greatest advantage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape, Paint &amp; Hide as Almost Anything</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/8cd0b285c668d984aab3ec5d365e8364.poster.avif?t=1786710545\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/8cd0b285c668d984aab3ec5d365e8364.webm?t=1786710545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/8cd0b285c668d984aab3ec5d365e8364.mp4?t=1786710545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom 3D objects using intuitive modeling tools, then paint them to perfectly match the environment. Powerful yet easy-to-use tools let you quickly create almost anything and seamlessly blend it into the environment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outsmart the Seekers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/2a1cd2950dd0d08c6bdebe866a7b5e39.poster.avif?t=1786710545\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/2a1cd2950dd0d08c6bdebe866a7b5e39.webm?t=1786710545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/2a1cd2950dd0d08c6bdebe866a7b5e39.mp4?t=1786710545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detail matters. Blend into the environment as accurately as possible, because even the smallest mistake can give you away. Seekers will inspect every object with suspicion, knowing that any one of them could be another player hiding in plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn, rewarding to master. As your skills improve, your camouflage becomes increasingly convincing. With practice, you'll recreate increasingly detailed and realistic objects that are almost impossible to spot.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Than a Dozen Unique Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4884050/extras/255ab953a9b71fe4546e5630238f2c9e.poster.avif?t=1786710545\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.